      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/c/34f0e0/{size}.png",
      "created_at": "2012-12-17T17:27:11.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p><span>You said you would have more SotM:EE games in December and perhaps I was overly optimistic. &nbsp;</span>I placed an order on December 6th. &nbsp;You took my money. &nbsp;I emailed GtG through the web contact form a week later on the 13th to ask for an update on my order because this was supposed to be a holiday gift. &nbsp;I have received no reply. &nbsp;I can make other arrangements; however, I need information to move forward. &nbsp;I need someone to reply to my email or my forum post and please tell me what to expect. &nbsp;Thank you!</p>",
