      "id": 49753,
      "name": "Paul",
      "username": "Paul",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/paul/{size}/5862_2.png",
      "created_at": "2012-12-17T21:16:30.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I apologize if your message on the website went un-responded-to. We have spoken with the shipper, and their current estimate for delivery is \"7-10 days\" from now. Their previous estimates have been off by quite a bit, but this is the shortest \"time to delivery\" estimate they've given us so far, so we can only hope that it is correct. In any case, as soon as we get the delivery, we will ship out all of our backorders ASAP, even if it means working on holidays and weekends. You will receive a FedEx tracking number for your online order as soon as it ships.</p>",
