      "name": "Kauboi",
      "username": "Kauboi",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/kauboi/{size}/2837_2.png",
      "created_at": "2012-12-19T19:25:40.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I'd placed my order on 30-Nov. No great rush, not needed for the holidays or anything. But would like to get a general idea, from the experiences of the organization, how long something like this might take (in general). As good as this game system is, waiting a month for delivery is acceptable (if not normal industry practice). You guys have made a h3[[ of a game and deserve lauds for it.</p>",
