      "id": 49759,
      "name": "Paul",
      "username": "Paul",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/paul/{size}/5862_2.png",
      "created_at": "2012-12-19T19:42:09.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>We have evidently been having some trouble with emails lately. Here is an update for all of you on the forum who are wondering about your order.&nbsp;<span>The games are currently in a cargo container on their way to the US from China, but the shipping company currently tells us that they are about a week out. That means that they are unlikely to arrive in time for Christmas. However, they should arrive some time a week later. As soon as they do, we will work overtime to ship out all of the games (I'm even planning to spend a chunk of Christmas packing games if they are here by then). You will receive a FedEx tracking number when they do ship.</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Thanks for your patience everyone, and sorry about the delay.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
      "post_number": 8,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T02:23:08.101Z",
      "reply_count": 0,
      "reply_to_post_number": null,
