    {
      "id": 49764,
      "name": "youperguy",
      "username": "youperguy",
      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/y/779978/{size}.png",
      "created_at": "2012-12-27T13:34:05.000Z",
      "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote group-playtesters\" data-username=\"Paul\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/paul/48/5862_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Paul:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>We have evidently been having some trouble with emails lately. Here is an update for all of you on the forum who are wondering about your order.&nbsp;The games are currently in a cargo container on their way to the US from China, but the shipping company currently tells us that they are about a week out. That means that they are unlikely to arrive in time for Christmas. However, they should arrive some time a week later. As soon as they do, we will work overtime to ship out all of the games (I'm even planning to spend a chunk of Christmas packing games if they are here by then). You will receive a FedEx tracking number when they do ship.&nbsp;Thanks for your patience everyone, and sorry about the delay.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Any updates on the orders? I notice the store here doesn't talk about things being on preorder.</p>",
      "post_number": 11,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T02:23:08.308Z",
      "reply_count": 0,
