      "raw": "[quote=\"Paul\"]\n\nWe have evidently been having some trouble with emails lately. Here is an update for all of you on the forum who are wondering about your order.&nbsp;The games are currently in a cargo container on their way to the US from China, but the shipping company currently tells us that they are about a week out. That means that they are unlikely to arrive in time for Christmas. However, they should arrive some time a week later. As soon as they do, we will work overtime to ship out all of the games (I&#39;m even planning to spend a chunk of Christmas packing games if they are here by then). You will receive a FedEx tracking number when they do ship.&nbsp;Thanks for your patience everyone, and sorry about the delay.&nbsp;&nbsp;\n\n[/quote]\n\n&nbsp;\n\nAny updates on the orders? I notice the store here doesn&#39;t talk about things being on preorder.\n",
