      "id": 49766,
      "name": "Paul",
      "username": "Paul",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/paul/{size}/5862_2.png",
      "created_at": "2012-12-27T22:40:20.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>We got a ridiculously huge cargo container full of games yesterday and spent all day unloading it. We are now beginning the packing and shipping process. Boxes will ship out in the order they were received, and you will get your tracking number as soon as we create the label (so if you ordered something that was out of stock in late October, for example, you should have your tracking number already). Everything ordered from our store should ship out by the end of the week, and brick-and-mortar stores should start having stock again in a couple of weeks.</p>",
